The source already refutes a central premise: the checked-in/current loop is no longer the rigid `8 × 12` nested grid described in the prompt. It uses one 100-thread OpenMP task team, with windows and band/precursor work expressed as tasks. I’m checking whether the measurements came from an older revision, because otherwise the requested 29% accounting is being applied to the wrong implementation.
