  1968	    // [fwhm] Measure the actual chromatographic peak width from the MS1 traces just built, and
  1969	    // use it to set the MS2 valley-splitting window. chrom_fwhm is an ABSOLUTE TIME, so a fixed
  1970	    // default cannot be right across methods: 14.0 s gave +0.0% peptides on a 31 min gradient
