codex
There is a second inconsistency in the source instrumentation: the stage accumulators are elapsed time around each window’s stage, yet the log labels them “CPU-seconds.” The supplied 8,139.5 s is therefore summed per-window elapsed time, exactly as you describe—not CPU work. That distinction lets me quantify outer occupancy, but it prevents attributing the remaining inner loss between trace bands and precursor chunks without one more counter or trace.
